    "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>QIK-VRT Mesh Universal Terminal</title>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; max-width: 70rem; }\n    code { background: #eee; padding: .15rem .35rem; }\n    li { margin: .6rem 0; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>QIK-VRT Mesh Universal Terminal</h1>\n  <p>Runtime entrypoint: <code>/AI/</code>. Canonical local Mesh URL: <code>/qik-vrt/mesh/v1/</code></p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"/qik-vrt/mesh/v1/terminal/vnc.html?autoconnect=true&amp;resize=scale&amp;reconnect=false&amp;path=qik-vrt%2Fmesh%2Fv1%2Fterminal%2Fwebsockify\">Firefox / noVNC terminal</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/qik-vrt/mesh/v1/effect-ack/.well-known/effect-ack\">Effect-Ack capability</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/qik-vrt/mesh/v1/effect-ack/AI\">TEMDD v0.1 IDE / local analysis</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/qik-vrt/mesh/v1/effect-ack/terminal/state\">Effect-Ack terminal state</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/qik-vrt/mesh/v1/healthz\">Mesh proxy health</a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>The Firefox link opens the existing Cloud Transputer operator session;\n  it is not a per-visitor isolated browser. A visible desktop or healthy gateway\n  is not a productive continuation receipt. Access policy and session isolation\n  require separate verification before public personal-browser admission.</p>\n  <p>This surface is a repository-bound runtime adapter. It does not itself assert publication,\n  deployment, empirical confirmation, PASS, FINAL_PASS, or EFFECT_ACK_DONE.</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
